        "original_id": "17156447-2040-5aaf-97f2-df35de648419",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joseph J. Thorndike, Paige Rense\n- Products: American Heritage, Bon Appétit, Life, Horizon, GEO, Manor House\n- Companies: Condé Nast\n- Topics: U.S. history, food, entertaining, publishing\n\nFacts:\n- In the late 1940s, Joseph J. Thorndike was managing editor of Life for three years.\n- Joseph J. Thorndike was a co-founder of American Heritage and Horizon magazines.\n- American Heritage is a magazine for mainstream readers that covers the history of the United States.\n- Bon Appétit is an American monthly magazine about food and entertaining published by Condé Nast.\n- Paige Rense founded the cookery magazine Bon Appétit.\n- Paige Rense was editor in chief of GEO.\n- In 1997, Paige Rense published the mystery novel Manor House with Doubleday.",
